26-10-19T09:55:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124577","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124577.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124577.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #122176\n\n## Additional information\n\nCause of issue: box container measures the child minimum sizes using old cross axis dimensions. A Fit Width texture therefore uses its previous height, which keeps the label/container resizing loop out of sync.\n\nFix: Apply cross axis sizing before measuring minimum size in box container\n\nMachine: (macOS 15.1 (24B83), Apple M1 MacBook Pro (MacBookPro17,1), 16 GB RAM.)\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124577/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}